{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainlesschain/chainlesschain/pulls/425","id":4797156408,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQgDM2s8AAAABHe7MOA","html_url":"https://github.com/chainlesschain/chainlesschain/pull/425","diff_url":"https://github.com/chainlesschain/chainlesschain/pull/425.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/chainlesschain/chainlesschain/pull/425.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainlesschain/chainlesschain/issues/425","number":425,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(cli-ide): complete gap engineering and release validation","user":{"login":"chainlesschain","id":247070867,"node_id":"U_kgDODroAkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247070867?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschain","html_url":"https://github.com/chainlesschain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\n补齐 CLI / IDE 差距报告中的工程缺口：模型审查保留可回读的上游材料，Windows 隔离工具链支持受控 esbuild 与 Node forks 并提供有限进程回收，双 IDE 修正协议和输入边界，JetBrains 审批卡增删时刷新外层布局，保证滚动区域重新分配高度。\n\n配对候选为 CLI `0.166.95`、Open VSX `0.37.140`、JetBrains `0.4.158`。双 IDE 推荐 CLI 版本同步；子 npm 包复用已发布的准确版本。更新用户指定的两份 2026-10-05 差距报告及实施、验证、原始证据索引。\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] New feature\n- [x] Bug fix\n- [x] Documentation update\n- [x] Test addition or update\n- [x] CI/CD change\n\n## Changes Made\n\n- 模型审查绑定提交、源码和实际输入摘要；失败也保存材料。官方 Codex stable release 解析拒绝 draft、prerelease 和异仓库 URL，发现版本漂移时保留退出结果。\n- Windows private v4 诊断用原始 HANDLE、独占通道、AppContainer SID、零 capabilities、同一 Job 及 FileID 绑定受控工具；支持 custodian 存活时回收与自身崩溃后的有限集合清理。\n- worker 终止报告的豁免要求真实调用成功和数值错误码。浏览器变更摘要流式计算，保留部分输出、启动失败和 signal 结果；Playwright 报告避免超大 patch 字符串在测试前失败。\n- 补齐 argv、policy precedence、跨 session ACK 与 APNG decodedPixels 的行为回归；当前 Handlebars 升级到官方 `4.7.10`，三份相关锁文件同步。\n- 权限并发 fixture 仅对存活持有者造成的明确未提交争用做有限重试；原生产锁期限、ownership 与断言保留。原生 goal 恢复用例明确有限功能预算并保存阶段计时。\n- JetBrains popup 在同一 EDT 操作内复核唯一目标并发送真实 Enter；审批、问题、计划卡刷新 JScrollPane 外层布局。保留真实按钮回调、事件和原 45 秒 UI 期限。\n- 默认关闭的 UI 阶段观察、失败 Swing 树及 IDE 日志原字节捕获保留原事件结果和异常。诊断缺失独立报告，原 Windows CI 缺卡机制仍未证明。\n- 证据绑定原始字节、来源与摘要；缩短 Windows checkout 路径，保留原 journey manifest，并明确归档路径映射。\n\n## Testing\n\n- [x] Unit / contract tests\n- [x] Native diagnostics\n- [ ] Exact release-head complete GitHub Actions matrix\n- [ ] Formal frozen provider / first-install acceptance\n\n### Test Configuration and Results\n\n待验证发行提交：`3caf14f2ee866335608487ab57add325972709d7`。发布前必须由它自己的 Linux / Windows / macOS CLI CI、CLI Strict、IDE Extensions 与 ARM64 完整门通过，不能沿用较旧提交的成功结果。\n\n- 533 项 Node 合同在 Windows / Linux Node `22.22.2` 各全部通过，runtime 分开统计；Windows 最低 Node 的沙箱祖先访问失败与主机权限下结果分别保存。\n- 当前 argv `20/20`、policy precedence `2/2`、ACK `2/2`、图像预算 `2/2`；独立源码反例产生真实行为断言失败。浏览器合同 `15/15`、权限合同 `14/14`，真实四进程争用后安全重试通过。\n- 模型目录 31 项与官方 SRI Handlebars 的 45 项模板测试通过。ESLint、Prettier、actionlint 和 spawn inventory 检查通过。\n- 当前 JetBrains Java：113 XML / 955 用例，952 通过、3 个原有 POSIX assumptions 跳过；smoke 1,445 项断言全部通过。布局 `2/2`、事件观察 `4/4` 是 JUnit 子集。\n- UI driver `13/13`、实际编译脚本 Rhino / Swing / EDT `6/6`；采集链路完整保留 757,780 字节 trace 和 300,004 字节 IDE 日志。以上均不能替代真实 IDE。\n- 当前审批布局批次 264 份原件及 manifest 与 Git index 逐字节一致；前序 CI 失败、初次 headful peer 失败和旧截断标记失败原件均保留。\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] 更新 CLI / IDE 两份报告、验证记录和证据索引。\n- [x] 新合同、来源验证和诊断已接入相关 CI 入口。\n- [x] 冻结源码、config、tests、plan 与正式 observations 保持原状态。\n- [ ] 准确发行提交的完整 Actions 门。\n\n## Performance Impact\n\nUI 阶段诊断在常规运行中默认关闭。隔离诊断保留既有进程数、每进程内存限额和权限边界。\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- [x] No\n\n## Security Considerations\n\n正式 36 tasks + 9 firstRuns、$99、时间窗口、分母及 observations 保持 `NOT_RUN`。冻结 Windows review 为 6 检出 / 4 存活 / 4 因基线失败未运行；完整基线 211 = 194 通过 / 16 失败 / 1 跳过，保持 `NOT_ADMITTED`。当前依赖仍有既有豁免，未声明 clean audit。\n\n## Related Issues/PRs\n\n- Follow-up to #423；当前公开配对为 CLI `0.166.94` / Open VSX `0.37.139` / JetBrains `0.4.157`。\n\n## Reviewer Notes\n\n重点复核原始 HANDLE 的 caller/op4 绑定、guard 与目标 Job 的不同证明范围、依赖来源及精确 payload、UI 诊断不改事件/失败、归档原字节及 source 映射。\n\n## Post-Merge Tasks\n\n- [ ] 完整准确提交门成功后，通过既有 GitHub Actions OIDC 发布 CLI；公开来源、子包安装验证成功后再发布 IDE。\n- [ ] 目标宿主、官方账户/账单、独立人工签核具备后采集正式 36+9。\n- [ ] Windows/macOS durable authority、受保护 journal、服务自身恢复、WFP、辅助技术和 8h/24h/SLO 独立验收。\n","created_at":"2026-10-09T06:56:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T18:15:46Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c8f6fef65a56d48a2539661b95bdd9a925d1d18d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainlesschain/chainlesschain/pulls/425/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainlesschain/chainlesschain/pulls/425/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainlesschain/chainlesschain/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainlesschain/chainlesschain/issues/425/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainlesschain/chainlesschain/statuses/3caf14f2ee866335608487ab57add325972709d7","head":{"label":"chainlesschain:feature/cli-ide-gap-completion-20261009","ref":"feature/cli-ide-gap-completion-20261009","sha":"3caf14f2ee866335608487ab57add325972709d7","user":{"login":"chainlesschain","id":247070867,"node_id":"U_kgDODroAkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247070867?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chainlesschai